  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHM 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo, umena lukanu wa Kilisto Yesu, ne Timote muanʼetu wa mu Kilisto, kudi Filemona munangibue ne muenu mudimu nʼetu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kudi Apia, muanʼetu mukashi wa mu Kilisto, ne kudi Âkipo, disalayi nʼetu dia Yesu, ne kudi ekelesia wa mu nsubu wandi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasa ikale nʼenu ne ditalala bia kudi Nzambi Tatu wetu ne kudi Mukelenge Yesu Kilisto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nsakidila Nzambi misangu yonso, ntela dina diebe mu milombu yanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua nakunua lumu lua dinanga diebe, ne lua ditabusha diudi nʼadi mu Mukelenge Yesu ne kudi basanto bonso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua buobumue buetu nʼebe mu ditabusha buenzeshe dimanya dilelela dia malu mimpe onso adi munda muenu, bualu bua Kilisto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua nakadi ne disanka dinene ne busambi bua dinanga diebe, bualu ba mitshima ya basanto yakakankauashibua bua bualu buebe, muanʼetm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, nasha meme ngikala ne dikima dia mu Kilisto bua kukuelela mukenshi wa bualu budi bukuakanyina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kedi udi ntamba kusua kukusengelela bualu bua dinanga; udi wamba bualu ebu mmeme Paulo, muetu mununu, ne katataka muena lukanu kabidi wa Kilisto Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nkusengelela bua muanʼanyi wa mu Kilisto Onesimo unakuela mu lukanu luanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diambedi yeye wakadi bu tshintu tshidi katshi tshilubuluka kûdi, kadi katataka udi bu tshintu tshidi tshilubuluka kûdi wewe ne kundi meme kabidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakamuhingisha kûdi, yeye muine, udi bu mutshima wanyi mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakasua yeye ashale kundi, bua yeye angenzelenzele mudimu bua bualu buebe mu lukanu mundi bua lumu luimpe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi tshiakasua kuenza bualu tshi muanze kumanya mûdi wela meshi, bua buimpe buebe kabuikadi bua ku bukole, kadi bua mu disua diebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bumue bua bualu ebu mbuakamumushilabo kûdi tshituha, bua wewe wikale nʼandi tshiendelele; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kembu muhika, kadi muhite muhika buimpe, muanʼenu munanga wa mu Kilisto, munangibue kundi tshishiki, kadi mutambe kunangibua kûdi, ne mu mubidi ne mu Mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku biwambala bu mukuatshishanganyi nʼebe, umuitabushe bu mûdi ungitabusha meme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bikaleye mukuenzele bibi, anyi muikale nʼebe dibanza, udibale bu dianyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meme Paulo nakufunda dî edi ne tshianza tshianyi: nenkufute; bua tshikuambidi bu mûdi wewe muine nʼanyi dibanza, muoyo webe mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, muanʼetu, mpeteku disanka dikumbana kûdi mu Mukelenge; ukankamasha mutshima wanyi mu Kilisto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua adi ntekemena ditumikila diebe, nakukufundila nunku, adi mumanye ne wewe newenze malu matambe andi nkuambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bualu bukuabo, undongoluele muaba wa kulala kabidi, ndi ntekemena bua kufikishibua kunudi bualu bua kulomba kuenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafa, udi muenu lukanu nʼanyi mu Kilisto Yesu, udi nkutumina muoyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne Mâko ne Alistâko ne Dema ne Luka, benji nʼanyi ba mumudi badi bakutumina muoyo kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasa wa Mukelenge wetu Yesu Kilisto ikale ne nyuma wenu. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
